y 41.0.1.Final matrix; Windows ZIP extraction is unchanged.","commit":1,"disposition":"fixed","key":"review:5473306504"},{"analysis":"The frozen Dockerfile forced .zip downloads and unzip for every Linux WildFly release. Added archiveFormat=tar.gz by default with explicit tar.gz/ZIP extraction and passed archiveFormat=zip only for 41.0.1.Final. Verified older HotSpot/OpenJ9 targets omit the override and Windows remains ZIP-based.","commit":1,"disposition":"fixed","key":"inline:4232806477"}],"input_identity":{},"outcome":"fixes","request_digest":"3c947a43e1c700d2ca37082b1f87fc975b4a70b5a1ff0759892b2a8cb4f5ed3a","schema":2},"download_sha256":"615ef39778af336aa5c23b0b6c420f98827c796e2f1d536e16ba59ca0131b406","frozen_sha":"183c19aa91c64849ed8a35a8a653d1c3366621f4","pr":20481,"publication_eligible":false,"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","request_digest":"3c947a43e1c700d2ca37082b1f87fc975b4a70b5a1ff0759892b2a8cb4f5ed3a","request_id":"9f0e88629d524ac0b69d2199c53245bd","run_attempt":1,"run_id":37969737974,"schema":2,"scope":"Structural/Git verification only. No target code or tests are executed.","server_artifact_digest":"sha256:615ef39778af336aa5c23b0b6c420f98827c796e2f1d536e16ba59ca0131b406","verification":"verified","verification_run":{"attempt":1,"id":37972198308},"workflow_revision":"83226dabf2d9223a1830ab774e229a41ec8a52c8"},"request":{"authorized_actor_id":218610,"baseline_review_ids":[5473282204,5473306504],"budgets":{"max_iterations":5,"propagation_seconds":120,"retention_days":14,"worker_timeout_minutes":30},"commit_author":{"id":218610,"login":"trask"},"findings":[{"body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udfe1 Changes recommended\n\nThe shared WildFly Dockerfile no longer preserves tar.gz extraction for older releases as required.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>1 open finding</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Preserve tar.gz extraction for older WildFly releases](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/pull/20481#discussion_r4232806477) \u00b7 New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nAdds Java 25 servlet smoke-test images for Payara 7 and WildFly 41.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Adds HotSpot, OpenJ9, and Windows-compatible image targets.\n- Adds ZIP extraction support for WildFly 41.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `smoke-tests/\u200bimages/\u200bservlet/\u200bbuild.gradle.kts` | Registers Payara 7 and WildFly 41 Java 25 targets. |\r\n| `smoke-tests/\u200bimages/\u200bservlet/\u200bsrc/\u200bwildfly.dockerfile` | Changes Linux WildFly extraction to ZIP. |\n</details>\n\n\ud83e\udde0 **Review effort:** Balanced\n\n---\n\n\ud83d\udca1 <a href=\"/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5473306504","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5473306504},{"body":"[General] This shared Dockerfile now selects ZIP for every Linux WildFly target, including 13, 17, 21, and 28\u201330. That contradicts the PR\u2019s stated requirement to preserve the existing tar.gz extraction path for older releases, and the claimed older-release tar validation can no longer exercise that path. Keep tar.gz as the default and pass a per-target archive format/extraction mode only for 41.0.1.Final.","comment_commit_id":"183c19aa91c64849ed8a35a8a653d1c3366621f4","comment_id":4232806477,"key":"inline:4232806477","kind":"inline","line":27,"original_commit_id":"183c19aa91c64849ed8a35a8a653d1c3366621f4","original_line":27,"path":"smoke-tests/images/servlet/src/wildfly.dockerfile","review_commit_id":"183c19aa91c64849ed8a35a8a653d1c3366621f4","review_id":5473306504,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-09T17:29:59Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"186e40d968a73dc6fc3c24fae18c3d021c6995e6357c346dc61f9cc9e7d6e9d0","id":4232806477,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-09T17:29:59Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86q4YOr"}],"frozen_at":1791568530,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-09T17:55:30Z","frozen_sha":"183c19aa91c64849ed8a35a8a653d1c3366621f4","head_ref":"copilot/add-java-25-smoke-tests","head_repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","head_repo_id":210933087,"input_mode":"direct","launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":37969660913},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","mode":"publish","pr":20481,"pr_author_id":198982749,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1791568532,"generation":1,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"2790848d13aa47ec8c84e2d1b4ed7cf4","profile":"git-candidate-v1","required_checks":[]},"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","repo_id":210933087,"request_id":"9f0e88629d524ac0b69d2199c53245bd","schema":2,"source_private":false,"target_private":false,"workflow_ref":"review-loop-revisions/83226dabf2d9223a1830ab774e229a41ec8a52c8","workflow_revision":"83226dabf